WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:04.710
Lamp for reps. Part four: working a file.

2
00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.990
Click a card to open its file.

3
00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:14.570
The top line shows the stage, the rep, and when it was filed. How it came in tells you which link they signed.

4
00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:19.640
Application PDF builds the full signed application, ready for funders.

5
00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:29.100
If the merchant signed from a link and has no account yet, it says so here. Their account opens when they sign in with that email.

6
00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:34.320
Work this file is where you run it. Change the stage, or see who owns it.

7
00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:38.980
Notes and calls are for the team. The merchant never sees them.

8
00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:46.730
Write what happened on every call, then press Add note. The next person to open the file knows exactly where it stands.

9
00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:56.940
Documents lists everything the merchant uploaded: statements, a voided check, photo ID, and the signed application.

10
00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:04.840
Need something? Click Request documents. Pick what it's for, tick what they need to send, and make the link.

11
00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:12.350
They drop the files in from their phone. No sign-in. Each file is dated, and tied to your request.

12
00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:19.290
On the right is the contact card. Name, business, email, phone, and whether they agreed to texts.

13
00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:27.230
Answers shows what they told us up front: how much, what for, monthly deposits, time in business, and credit.

14
00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:36.930
Full application holds Social Security numbers and dates of birth. Only you and the admins can open it, and every view is logged.

15
00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:44.420
Timeline is the file's history. Every stage change, document, offer and note, with the time.

16
00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:54.910
To send an application yourself, open Applications, and click Send a new application. Add their name, business and email.

17
00:01:56.850 --> 00:02:03.360
Email it has Lamp send the link from the partners mailbox. Copy link gives it to you to text.

18
00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:09.090
Every link you send is listed here, with when it was opened, started and signed.

19
00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:12.010
Next: funders and offers.
